{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a7f3c1e2-5d84-4b10-9e63-0c2f8a114d75",
    "name": "ET-001 - PoC S4H Customer API",
    "description": "Colección de la PoC ET-001: migración de interfaces PI/PO a APIs sobre SAP BTP.\n\nExpone el objeto de negocio RAP ZCDS_CUSTOMER de S/4HANA 2025 como servicio OData V4, publicado a través de SAP API Management.\n\n## Requisitos\n\nImportar también el entorno `ET-001-PoC.postman_environment.json` y cumplimentar sus variables antes de ejecutar.\n\n## Autenticación\n\nLa colección inyecta la cabecera `APIKey` en todas las peticiones mediante la autorización a nivel de colección. Las carpetas 05 y 06 la sobrescriben a propósito.\n\n## Orden de ejecución\n\nLas carpetas 00 a 05 deben ejecutarse en orden: hay dependencias reales entre peticiones. La 01 obtiene el token CSRF que necesitan todas las escrituras.\n\nLa carpeta 04 termina borrando los registros creados, de modo que la colección puede reejecutarse sin errores de clave duplicada.\n\nLa carpeta 06 apunta directamente al backend, sin pasar por BTP, y solo funciona desde dentro de la red corporativa.\n\nDocumentación completa: docs/ET-001-PoC-CDS-RAP-BTP-Postman.md",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "APIKey",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{api_key}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Aserción global: ningún error de servidor en ninguna petición.",
          "pm.test(\"Sin error de servidor (5xx)\", function () {",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.below(500);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 — Verificación del servicio",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "R1 - Documento de servicio",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{apim_host}}{{base_path}}/",
            "description": "Catálogo de entity sets. Prueba mínima de que el proxy enruta al backend."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Publica el entity set Customer\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include(\"Customer\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "R2 - Metadatos ($metadata)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/xml"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{apim_host}}{{base_path}}/$metadata",
            "description": "Contrato formal de la interfaz, equivalente al WSDL de un servicio SOAP de PI/PO."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"El EDMX declara la entidad Customer\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('EntityType Name=\"Customer\"');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"La entidad admite escritura\", function () {",
                  "    var x = pm.response.text();",
                  "    pm.expect(x.indexOf(\"Insertable=\\\"false\\\"\")).to.eql(-1);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 — Sesión (token CSRF)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "R3 - Obtener token CSRF",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-CSRF-Token",
                "value": "Fetch"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{apim_host}}{{base_path}}/",
            "description": "Obligatoria antes de cualquier escritura. El token queda en la variable csrf_token y la cookie de sesión en el Cookie Jar de Postman. Ambos son necesarios."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var token = pm.response.headers.get(\"X-CSRF-Token\");",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Se ha recibido token CSRF\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(token).to.be.a(\"string\").and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"csrf_token\", token);",
                  "    console.log(\"Token CSRF almacenado en la variable csrf_token\");",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.warn(\"Sin token: revisar la propagación de cabeceras en API Management (§10.5d)\");",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 — Altas",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "R4 - Alta cliente 1",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-CSRF-Token",
                "value": "{{csrf_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{apim_host}}{{base_path}}/{{entity_set}}",
            "description": "Alta del primer registro. Respuesta esperada 201 Created.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"Customer\": \"{{test_customer}}\",\n  \"CityName\": \"Monterrey\",\n  \"Region\": \"NLE\",\n  \"Country\": \"MX\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Devuelve la clave enviada\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().Customer).to.eql(pm.environment.get(\"test_customer\"));",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Los cuatro campos del contrato están presentes\", function () {",
                  "    var r = pm.response.json();",
                  "    [\"Customer\", \"CityName\", \"Region\", \"Country\"].forEach(function (c) {",
                  "        pm.expect(r).to.have.property(c);",
                  "    });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "R5 - Alta cliente 2",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-CSRF-Token",
                "value": "{{csrf_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{apim_host}}{{base_path}}/{{entity_set}}",
            "description": "Segundo registro, para que las consultas devuelvan más de una fila.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"Customer\": \"{{test_customer_2}}\",\n  \"CityName\": \"Guadalajara\",\n  \"Region\": \"JAL\",\n  \"Country\": \"MX\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Devuelve la clave enviada\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().Customer).to.eql(pm.environment.get(\"test_customer_2\"));",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Los cuatro campos del contrato están presentes\", function () {",
                  "    var r = pm.response.json();",
                  "    [\"Customer\", \"CityName\", \"Region\", \"Country\"].forEach(function (c) {",
                  "        pm.expect(r).to.have.property(c);",
                  "    });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 — Consultas",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "R6 - Lectura por clave",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{apim_host}}{{base_path}}/{{entity_set}}('{{test_customer}}')",
            "description": "La clave viaja entre comillas simples. Debe ir en formato interno, con ceros a la izquierda (§11.8a)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Es el registro solicitado\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().Customer).to.eql(pm.environment.get(\"test_customer\"));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "R7 - Paginación ($top)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{apim_host}}{{base_path}}/{{entity_set}}?$top=10",
            "description": "Limita el número de registros devueltos."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Se devuelven registros\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().value.length).to.be.above(0);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiempo de respuesta por debajo de 2000 ms\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(2000);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "R8 - Filtrado ($filter)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{apim_host}}{{base_path}}/{{entity_set}}?$filter=Country eq 'MX'&$top=20",
            "description": "Filtrado en servidor. En PI/PO cada variante habría exigido un proxy nuevo."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Se devuelven registros\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().value.length).to.be.above(0);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Tiempo de respuesta por debajo de 2000 ms\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(2000);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Todos los registros son del país filtrado\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.json().value.forEach(function (r) {",
                  "        pm.expect(r.Country).to.eql(\"MX\");",
                  "    });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "R9 - Proyección, orden y conteo",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{apim_host}}{{base_path}}/{{entity_set}}?$select=Customer,CityName&$orderby=CityName asc&$count=true",
            "description": "En OData V4 el conteo es $count=true; en V2 era $inlinecount=allpages."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Incluye el conteo total\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property(\"@odata.count\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Solo devuelve los campos proyectados\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().value[0]).to.not.have.property(\"Country\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 — Modificación y baja",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "R10 - Modificación (PATCH)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-CSRF-Token",
                "value": "{{csrf_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{apim_host}}{{base_path}}/{{entity_set}}('{{test_customer}}')",
            "description": "PATCH envía solo los campos que cambian. PUT exigiría el registro completo.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"CityName\": \"Monterrey Centro\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 200 o 204\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 204]);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "R11 - Baja del cliente 2 (DELETE)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-CSRF-Token",
                "value": "{{csrf_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{apim_host}}{{base_path}}/{{entity_set}}('{{test_customer_2}}')",
            "description": "Baja del segundo registro."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 204\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(204);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "R12 - Verificar la baja",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{apim_host}}{{base_path}}/{{entity_set}}('{{test_customer_2}}')",
            "description": "Un 404 aquí es éxito, no fallo."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 404\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// 404 es el resultado correcto: confirma que el borrado se materializó."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "R13 - Limpieza del cliente 1",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-CSRF-Token",
                "value": "{{csrf_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{apim_host}}{{base_path}}/{{entity_set}}('{{test_customer}}')",
            "description": "Deja la tabla en su estado inicial para que la colección pueda reejecutarse sin errores de clave duplicada."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 204\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(204);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 — Pruebas negativas",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "N1 - Consulta sin API Key",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{apim_host}}{{base_path}}/{{entity_set}}?$top=1",
            "description": "Criterio CA-16. Si devuelve 200, la policy Verify API Key no está activa o falta volver a desplegar el proxy.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Rechazada sin API Key (401 o 403)\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([401, 403]);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "N2 - Alta sin token CSRF",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{apim_host}}{{base_path}}/{{entity_set}}",
            "description": "Criterio CA-17. Si el alta se completa, la protección CSRF está deshabilitada en el backend: es un hallazgo de seguridad.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"Customer\": \"0000009999\",\n  \"CityName\": \"Prueba negativa\",\n  \"Region\": \"NLE\",\n  \"Country\": \"MX\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Rechazada sin token CSRF (403)\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"El motivo es la validación CSRF\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.text().toLowerCase()).to.include(\"csrf\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "06 — Backend directo (validación F2)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "F2.1 - Metadatos contra el backend",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/xml"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{backend_url}}/$metadata?sap-client={{sap_client}}",
            "description": "Ejecutar desde dentro de la red corporativa. Aísla el objeto RAP del resto de la cadena.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{sap_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{sap_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "F2.2 - Token CSRF contra el backend",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-CSRF-Token",
                "value": "Fetch"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{backend_url}}/?sap-client={{sap_client}}",
            "description": "El token queda en csrf_token_backend, separado del que emite el proxy.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{sap_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{sap_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var token = pm.response.headers.get(\"X-CSRF-Token\");",
                  "pm.test(\"Se ha recibido token CSRF del backend\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(token).to.be.a(\"string\").and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "if (token) { pm.environment.set(\"csrf_token_backend\", token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "F2.3 - Alta contra el backend",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-CSRF-Token",
                "value": "{{csrf_token_backend}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{backend_url}}/Customer?sap-client={{sap_client}}",
            "description": "Cierra la validación F2. No avanzar a la configuración de BTP sin obtener 201.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"Customer\": \"0000000001\",\n  \"CityName\": \"Prueba F2\",\n  \"Region\": \"NLE\",\n  \"Country\": \"MX\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{sap_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{sap_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Código de estado 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});"
                ]
